---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = "July 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now"
  description="What Prasad Vaidya is focused on right now: a personal knowledge base, local LLM experiments, health, jazz guitar, and the road to independent products."
>
  <div class="container page">
    <h1>Now</h1>
    <p class="updated">What I'm focused on at the moment. Last updated {updated}.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Building</h2>
      <p>
        The main project is a personal knowledge base: capture notes, voice memos,
        and screenshots, then get the right context back when you're actually working.
        It's at MVP and I'm pushing it toward daily use. The email-to-task workflow I
        built earlier is live and mostly runs itself now.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Local models</h2>
      <p>
        Evenings go to OpenClaw and LM Studio, testing tool calling and agent
        orchestration with small models on modest hardware. The point is to learn
        where local models genuinely hold up, not to avoid paying for an API.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Health</h2>
      <p>
        Strength training, nutrition experiments, and sleep tracking. Progress is
        boring on purpose: repeated weeks, small adjustments, nothing heroic.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Guitar</h2>
      <p>
        Jazz, slowly. I keep practice logs and do ear training instead of comfortable
        noodling, and I keep sketching small tools that would make practice less
        aimless.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Independent products</h2>
      <p>
        The long-term plan is to go from technical leadership to products of my own.
        Everything above feeds into that one way or another.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="note">
      This is a <a class="link" href="https://nownownow.com/about">now page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  section p {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
